High five.

48
00:04:34,441 --> 00:04:35,610
Give it to me. I need it.

49
00:04:35,743 --> 00:04:36,811
I need it.

50
00:04:40,480 --> 00:04:41,582
Okay, Paul.

51
00:04:42,950 --> 00:04:44,252
