57
00:05:36,436 --> 00:05:37,705
Take it easy.

58
00:05:38,639 --> 00:05:40,241
Don't be mad at me, Ladybug.

59
00:05:40,373 --> 00:05:42,143
I'm not mad at you.

60
00:05:42,276 --> 00:05:43,311
